DESCRIPTION:BI SIG Dimensional Modeling Focus Group Presents:\nMulti-dimens
	ional Modeling for Performance Management \nSpeaker: Cherie Sheriff\nMay 2
	1st 1:00pm ET \nTopic Description: The first in a short series about how y
	ou can use multi-dimensional modeling to show how well you are performing\
	, how to create budgets or strategic plans and how to create forecasts.  L
	earn how to leverage SSAS and SSRS to give your company the tools it needs
	 to save time and money.  In the Performance Management session\, learn ho
	w to generate easily understood views of the actuals. \n\n\nNotes  \nBlyth
	e Morrow has invited you to attend an online meeting using Live Meeting. J
	oin the meeting. <https://owa.sqlpass.org/owa/redir.aspx?URL=https%3a%2f%2
	fwww.livemeeting.com%2fcc%2fusergroups%2fjoin%3fid%3dN2893B%26role%3datten
	d>  \n\nAudio Information \nTelephone conferencing\nUse the information be
	low to connect: \nToll-free: +1 (866) 379-8990 \nParticipant code: 6489756
	 \nFirst Time Users: \nTo save time before the meeting\, check your system
	  <https://owa.sqlpass.org/owa/redir.aspx?URL=http%3a%2f%2fgo.microsoft.co
	m%2ffwlink%2f%3fLinkId%3d90703> to make sure it is ready to use Microsoft 
	Office Live Meeting. \nTroubleshooting\nUnable to join the meeting? Follow
	 these steps: \n1.	Copy this address and paste it into your web browser: \
	nhttps://www.livemeeting.com/cc/usergroups/join <https://owa.sqlpass.org/o
	wa/redir.aspx?URL=https%3a%2f%2fwww.livemeeting.com%2fcc%2fusergroups%2fjo
	in>  \n2.	Copy and paste the required information: \nMeeting ID: N2893B \n
	Location: https://www.livemeeting.com/cc/usergroups <https://owa.sqlpass.o
	rg/owa/redir.aspx?URL=https%3a%2f%2fwww.livemeeting.com%2fcc%2fusergroups>
	  \nIf you still cannot enter the meeting\, contact support <https://owa.s
	qlpass.org/owa/redir.aspx?URL=http%3a%2f%2fr.office.microsoft.com%2fr%2frl
	idLiveMeeting%3fp1%3d12%26p2%3den_US%26p3%3dLMInfo%26p4%3dsupport> \n\nNot
	ice \nMicrosoft Office Live Meeting can be used to record meetings. By par
	ticipating in this meeting\, you agree that your communications may be mon
	itored or recorded at any time during the meeting. \n\n\n
